                          "text":  "I left Earth on September 5, 1977. My job was to visit two planets, Jupiter and Saturn. I was built to last about five years.\n\nAt Jupiter I photographed storms bigger than Earth, and volcanoes erupting on a moon called Io. Nobody expected that. At Saturn I flew close to the giant moon Titan and found it hidden under thick orange haze. That close pass bent my path upward, out of the flat disc where the planets travel. There were no more worlds ahead of me after that.",
